Fellow warriors:
After the launch of the game, we found that some players appeared the pop-up window of "About prompt" and "Prompt problem", which caused the game to be unable to play. We are very sorry. After technical investigation, we found the cause of the problem, and steamID verification will be conducted when the game is launched. If network fluctuations occur during this period, the following measures can be taken:
1, check whether steam is online mode;
2, temporarily shut down the vpn (mainland players) in use, after entering the game can continue to open;
3. Uninstall the game and install it on another disk.
4, if there are players using tinder, need to authorize the game network, the specific operation: "Open the protection center - system protection - network control - selection program, to authorize the game network", other butlers are the same
